<title>JAPAN: US surcharges on Japan ships seen at Y5 bln yearly.</title>
<headline>US surcharges on Japan ships seen at Y5 bln yearly.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. surcharges on Japanese shipping firms would amount to five billion yen annually if they were to go into effect, Noboru Sakata, chairman of the Japan Shipowners' Port Council, told reporters on Thursday.</p>
</text>
